{
  "id": "MAT.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 16",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gassooda ng'asheega deamdeameadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay heeda Farisaayajeega ea Sadukayajeega ak gwasimsim nea gamus gideaba, eadaaha gwadeagooda leabu humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha saawa, “Iissa iihita shing'ada gooyeenyi, ‘Jeameeda numuji gajea miy aba gideaba humng'eeda ea areara.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iighar gayeew iissa gooyeenyi, ‘Askweareani gaygwarukusa, aba gideaba humng'eeda ea areara nea ghwanung' eabeal.’ Ghoamuuschi anala damanyoojiga iyoong'ulayi humng'eeda, nea moamuusi anala gwadeagwajeega damanyoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seaygeeda munyas mealuuleadi ak gagasa gwadeagooda, ak ea mwajeataw geaghus gwadeagooda ghayi bea Yona.” Ng'ata ghwanung'wa heeda ak ghang'eat gawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidamwataw bea Farisaayajeega ea Sadukayajeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay giinealanga ea ghwahita giigheawda, nea niroosa eadita mukaatajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Ang'ula nea gooshageachi geat aba gidamwataw bea Farisaayajeega ea dea Sadukayajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasheang'nyi saawa nea gabwa geat, nea gwayi, “Miyeeyeana mukaatajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajeeng'u Yesu gidabaloola saawa ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda agooga goosheang'nyi sea fuga manang'i masawi, aba gideaba moondeawani mukaatajeega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mii anala eara ghamneawa? Moapkaadi eara mukaatajeegiga amuut aba fugiga as sagalamnyooji muudiin, ak gooweamsi gheaptanga sooscheew hada? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana mukaatajeegiga asispwa silakiisa fugiga asagalamaji ang'waniin, heapi ghoawaamnyi sooscheew hada nyiit gheaptanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghoawataan ea moapkaadi gideaba meabaloolani ng'asheega mukaatajeega? Asi ashageada geat aba gidamwataw bea Farisaayajeega ea Sadukayajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajeeng'u gideaba gwachi mabaloolana gideaba mayeeshiina ashageada geat aba gidamwataw, gabaloola giinealshooda Farisaayajeega ea Sadukayajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Betaro goodeaga geaw Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu nea gawa Yesu ng'eanyiida Gaysariyayda Filipi, ghoanyaash giinealangaaschi nea gwayeesha, “Buuneeda gwayeena Orjeeda Siida ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha, “Buuneeda mwaatkwa gwayeena Yohaneeda Abaatiisachi, suurja gwayeena Eliya, suurja gwayeena Yeremiya ghanea siyagi gil aba jeeda sibanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Ama agooga gooyeenayi aniini geewooschi ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Simoneeda was Betaro nea gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi Gristo, Orjeeda ASEETA majeek.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha niny, “Ging'wani ang'iing'i, Simoneeda Bar-Yona! Aba gideaba ng'asheanji moadaajiida saseeda ea foojeanda nih ghoahiimneey Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayeeshiineey, ang'iing'i guwoosi Betaro, ak badaydeaba lagheaneani gaydadeeksa ganiiseedeanyu, ak eara uurda miyeeda ea mayghoamu ghwajoar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydagoonyi gichea atinana sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda, ak gidiradi aba hiji bea muunda ng'eanyiidean abeeda gajea sirat aba hoowa bea humng'eedean, ak gida wassean iitini aba hiji bea muunda ng'eanyiidean abeeda gajeetin aba hoowa bea humng'eedean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ghaweada muuchi giinealangaaschi ea marukusiina siida wassean gideaba niny Gristohi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola iita sawanadeadaanyi ea miyeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada damandida gwarukusa Yesu giinealangaaschi gideaba gammiisa beata jea gawa Yerusalemu, ak aba hoowa gayghwanyas sawanadeeda haw aba heeda gweargwa ea ashoohoodiga hees ea ng'oorshoodiga, ak geenuus, ama eaweeteaba samwagu gwaduudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat Betaro ea gameaji gwadilda ak goojuursa nea gwayeesha, “Mwayiinya ASEETA, Ng'utamiida! Ng'asheesu mayghwanyasnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayamsa geaw ak gwayeesha, Betaro, “Una badaydeanyu shataani! Adiruusean; aba gideaba mindani meatkweeda ASEETA, gindi dea buuneeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida gwayeesha Yesu giinealangaaschi, “Siida wassean iigasa gweadu geeshteanyu ea dafoola geaw ak ghwasar beehiidaanyi ak gweadu geeshteanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida gasa ghoaghu eaweagaaschi gaygahuteawi, nea siida huteawi eaweagaaschi aba badaydeanyu, gayghwadaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama siida gaygwaloosa naaha iinyas haleanjeeda sean bea muunda ng'eanyiida, amadu gahuteawi eaweagaaschi? Ghana siida gayghoadayda naaha ak ghoaghiisa eaweagaaschi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Orjeeda Siida gayghoana giigheambiita Ghwaan nea goodeana malaykajeega ak abeeda gayghoadaw gilinyoo ea sihi gidageatindaanyi aba sinaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, gwanda hiji bea jeedeang'wean fuga maygameewa, ea eaghus ea nidaah Orjeeda Siida nea ghoana jeeda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
